{"2910270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fireworks-Bomb-GoodFriends", "steam_appid": 2910270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re back in your childhood, and it’s still the turn of the millennium—<i>and there are people here!</i> Invite your best friends to set off fireworks together! There are no firework bans back then—<strong>let the sparks fly!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See all the familiar fireworks from your childhood here. Challenge your friends to an epic <strong>firework duel</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910270/extras/2eb5a63532aba312f827a4723073247e.poster.avif?t=1782482171\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910270/extras/2eb5a63532aba312f827a4723073247e.webm?t=1782482171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910270/extras/2eb5a63532aba312f827a4723073247e.mp4?t=1782482171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>—Get Your Fireworks—</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your red envelopes, then head to the supermarket to stock up on fireworks!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910270/extras/c9de8bef882ba62618a1703196969f6b.poster.avif?t=1782482171\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910270/extras/c9de8bef882ba62618a1703196969f6b.webm?t=1782482171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910270/extras/c9de8bef882ba62618a1703196969f6b.mp4?t=1782482171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>—Choose Your Battlefield—</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire old downtown from the turn of the millennium is your ultimate battleground!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910270/extras/917b4dfa205b4d8491848b7eae14a577.poster.avif?t=1782482171\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910270/extras/917b4dfa205b4d8491848b7eae14a577.webm?t=1782482171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910270/extras/917b4dfa205b4d8491848b7eae14a577.mp4?t=1782482171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>--Let the firework war begin--</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the chaos head-on and make up for the childhood regret of never having a fireworks showdown with your pals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910270/extras/3164d83bf4af6f610de0b6b3257e2324.poster.avif?t=1782482171\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910270/extras/3164d83bf4af6f610de0b6b3257e2324.webm?t=1782482171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2910270/extras/3164d83bf4af6f610de0b6b3257e2324.mp4?t=1782482171\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>—Free-Style Firework Ignition—</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragra